Package: blockr.viz
Title: Chart and Table Blocks for 'blockr'
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Christoph",
           family = "Sax",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "christoph@cynkra.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7192-7044")),
    person(given = "ZumerLab",
           role = "cph",
           comment = "SnapDOM, bundled in inst/js/vendor/snapdom.js")
    )
Description: Two blocks for 'blockr' boards. The chart block draws bar,
    histogram, waterfall, pie, treemap, box, point-range, scatter, line,
    area, band and timeline charts with 'ECharts', aggregating the rows
    where the chart type asks for it. The table block shows the rows, one
    row per group with a column per summary, or one row per statistic of
    each variable, as a table, a compact matrix or cards. A click on either
    filters the blocks downstream. Both download as 'Excel', a web page, an
    image or 'PowerPoint'.
